  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Safety Conference for Women Journalists: Gendered Experiences in Election Coverage</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Specialised training to equip women journalists with knowledge and skills to navigate the specific risks they face, including gender-based online and offline harassment, while ensuring their accurate, impartial and secure coverage of electoral processes.</narrative>
  </description>
